\section{Which colours for which job}{

\itemize{
\item Groups (arms, units, diagnoses): a categorical palette, e.g. \code{hl_use(palette = "calm")}.
\item Two groups (intervention, control): a pair, \code{hl_use(palette = "pair")}.
